      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAX PEARL (3) comes off a big run when second in a solid 16.66 at this track over 300m. Hard to top on the time from last start. AGENT TWENTY ONE (8) impressed when clocking an exceptional 22.43 over 400m at Geelong three back then has hit the frame in both runs since. Expecting another bold showing. LILLY ZOOM (6) is a well performed sprinter ideally suited at the shorter trips. Last start placegetter over 425m at Traralgon in a Grade 5 (24.36) but sharper journey suits this time. Has never missed the frame at the trip from five starts. Expected to feature. SMART ROSCOE (1) was strongly fancied on the back of a win two starts back but finished second last time (17.04) at this track. The form from his last run stacks up well.",
